@crew torres-zeke
// SAMPLE (the dialogue engineer, 0.43.0): one person baked end to end so the kit can be seen working.
// The head writer and the Works writer replace these with the real lines.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- {hi}. You'll be the new hand.
- {hi}. Zeke Torres, engines. You must be the new cadet.
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- {hi}, {nick}. Coil three's sulking. Don't take it personally.   #funny
- Morning! Board's light today. Don't tell it I said so.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {nick}. Come to listen to the coils hum?
- There you are. Hold still a second, I'm measuring you for a scarf.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- {nick}! I was hoping you'd come by. The coils behave better when you're about.   #warm

== feel
? mood:low
- Long one. Coil three sulked all shift.
? mood:high
- Good day below. Everything humming in tune.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I know the words to every song in the music room's record cabinet. Every one.
- Breakfast? Never. I'd rather have ten more minutes with the coils.
